{
  "source": "runtime capture (SkyZH) 2026-09-10 花园实测; 语境核对 https://hypixelskyblock.minecraft.wiki/w/The_Garden#SkyMart、/Builder%27s_Ruler、/HydroCan%E2%84%A2_1000、/Peony_Set、/Copper_Talisman、/SkyMart_Brochure、/Large_Walnut、/Garden_Chips、/Farming_Tools、/Barn_Skins、/Greenhouse_Skins",
